======================================================================
  3. MERGED VERTEX SEQUENCE
======================================================================

  V_merged = (A000568 + SC) / 2:
  n=3: V_merged = (2 + 2)/2 = 2 (100.0% of A000568)
  n=4: V_merged = (4 + 2)/2 = 3 (75.0% of A000568)
  n=5: V_merged = (12 + 8)/2 = 10 (83.3% of A000568)
  n=6: V_merged = (56 + 12)/2 = 34 (60.7% of A000568)
  n=7: V_merged = (456 + 88)/2 = 272 (59.6% of A000568)
  n=8: V_merged = (6880 + 176)/2 = 3528 (51.3% of A000568)
  n=9: V_merged = (191536 + 2752)/2 = 97144 (50.7% of A000568)
  n=10: V_merged = (9733056 + 8784)/2 = 4870920 (50.0% of A000568)

  V_merged / A000568 -> 50% as SC fraction -> 0.
  At large n: V_merged ~ A000568 / 2 (every class pairs with complement).

